  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), after this unit makes an **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)** or **[fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)**, it can still shoot and can still declare a charge that turn. When it does, it cannot pick as a target:\n\n- any unit it was in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of as the turn began\n- any unit that another unit has charged or attacked this phase",
